  ('relationship_proof', 'Evidence to prove your relationship', 'Evidence must come from the government, a bank, landlord, utility provider, or a medical professional; confirm your relationship with your partner; and be less than 4 years old. Examples given: marriage or civil partnership certificate, tenancy agreement, utility bills, Council Tax bills, a joint bank statement, or a letter from your doctor or dentist confirming you live at the same address.', 'relationship', true, 1, 'https://www.gov.uk/uk-family-visa/partner-spouse'),
  ('alternative_relationship_evidence', 'Other evidence you can provide instead', 'If you do not have evidence that meets the main criteria, other evidence can include a one-off bill like vet’s fees or home repair costs, letters confirming you and your partner are on the voting register for the same address, or student finance paperwork confirming that you live at the same address.', 'relationship', false, 2, 'https://www.gov.uk/uk-family-visa/partner-spouse'),
  ('ongoing_commitment_evidence', 'Evidence of an ongoing commitment to each other', 'If you cannot live together because of work or study, or for cultural reasons, provide evidence that you communicate regularly, support each other financially, care for any children you have together, and spend time together as a couple, for example on holiday or at events.', 'relationship', false, 3, 'https://www.gov.uk/uk-family-visa/partner-spouse'),
