  ('previous_marriages_ended', 'Proof any previous marriages or civil partnerships have ended', 'Required if applying as a fiancé, fiancée or proposed civil partner.', 'civil_status', false, 7, 'https://www.gov.uk/uk-family-visa/partner-spouse')
